  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A trader mob. msm:trader opens the villager trading screen when a player uses it with an empty hand. \"trade_sets\" lists its levels: level 1 offers msm_examples:roadside_merchant/level_1, and 10 trading experience (\"xp_to_next\") unlocks level 2, msm_examples:roadside_merchant/level_2. \"levels\" true makes trading earn experience; \"restock\" twice_a_day refills the trades at the mob, with no workstation. \"trade_sound\" plays on each trade and \"on_trade\" fires msm_examples:roadside_merchant_sold (self is the merchant, other the player), which rings a bell. It refuses to trade while a baby, fleeing or ridden, and keeps its offers when the world is saved. It has a spawn egg and never spawns on its own. It needs the Fabric mod jar export; the vanilla packs keep only its trades, tags, pictures and language keys.",
    "tags": [
      "example",
      "entities"
    ]
  }
